</textAttrs>
</DOMTextRun>
<DOMTextRun>
<characters>t need to predict enemy positions; hitting enemies in your game causes damage.</characters>
<textAttrs>
<DOMTextAttrs alignment="left" rotation="true" indent="0.0" leftMargin="0.0" autoKern="true" lineSpacing="2.15" rightMargin="0.0" size="8" bitmapSize="160" face="DejaVu Sans Mono Bold" fillColor="#ffffff"/>
</textAttrs>
</DOMTextRun>
<DOMTextRun>
<characters/>
<textAttrs>
<DOMTextAttrs alignment="left" rotation="true" indent="0.0" leftMargin="0.0" autoKern="false" lineSpacing="2.15" rightMargin="0.0" size="8" bitmapSize="160" face="DejaVu Sans Mono Bold"/>
</textAttrs>
</DOMTextRun>
<DOMTextRun>
<characters>- The time it takes for your shots to damage enemies is also affected by network latency.</characters>
<textAttrs>
<DOMTextAttrs alignment="left" rotation="true" indent="0.0" leftMargin="0.0" autoKern="true" lineSpacing="2.15" rightMargin="0.0" size="8" bitmapSize="160" face="DejaVu Sans Mono Bold" fillColor="#ffffff"/>
</textAttrs>
</DOMTextRun>
<DOMTextRun>
<characters/>
